# PersonaAI MVP lock

Source of truth:

- Product: `PersonaAI_MVP_Product_Design.md`
- Build: `PersonaAI_Implementation_Plan.md`

## Do not expand MVP

Out of scope until post-validation: Gmail/Calendar, voice cloning, WhatsApp, autonomous agents, fine-tuning, mobile app, marketplace, multi-LLM routing, category packs.

Frontend never calls the LLM. All AI goes through FastAPI.

## Build order

Implement Phase 0 → 5 only. Do not start the next phase until the previous deliverable works.

## Screens

Only routes in Implementation Plan §5. If a feature is not listed, it waits.

## Stack

- `apps/web` — Next.js App Router + TypeScript + Tailwind
- `apps/api` — FastAPI
- Postgres + pgvector, Redis for jobs
